        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "VO2max, Lactate Threshold, and Aerobic Capacity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nVO2max = maximal rate of oxygen consumption during progressive exercise.\nUnits: mL O₂/kg body weight/min (relative VO2max — most useful for weight-bearing sports)\n       L O₂/min (absolute VO2max — useful for cycling, rowing)"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-VO2MAX.md#010",
      "path": [
        "02-VO2MAX.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:sports-science:02-vo2max, git-history:sports-science:02-vo2max]",
