        "section": "sports-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "VO2max, Lactate Threshold, and Aerobic Capacity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "WHAT IT MEASURES:\n  The upper limit of aerobic metabolism. At VO2max, oxygen delivery\n  and/or utilization is maximized. Additional work relies entirely\n  on anaerobic systems (which cannot be sustained)."
    },
