        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "VO2max, Lactate Threshold, and Aerobic Capacity",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "VO2max IS NOT:\n  - The maximum you can run\n  - The pace you can hold for long events\n  - A direct predictor of elite performance among trained athletes\n    (lactate threshold and economy predict better within trained groups)\n```"
